    "gs",
    "driver",
    "sound",
    "zx-masters"
  ],
  "summary": "Called from the game's stubs with bank 1 paged: sends an effect (#2E select, #40 note, #80+c play), each command after the card took the one before (IN $BB bits 0 and 7); LevelChange swaps the level loader in at $61A8, loads the level's module and effects to the card and swaps back; RoundWait waits or fades the module between rounds.",
